<title>UK: WestHyp prices 1.0 bln mark Oct 2003 Pfandbrief.</title>
<headline>WestHyp prices 1.0 bln mark Oct 2003 Pfandbrief.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced earler by joint lead managers Bayerische Hypothekenbank, Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTFALISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.0 PCT   MATURITY    20.OCT.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.32     PAY DATE   S03.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  27.5 BP   REOFFER    98.15     SPREAD	+10 BP</p>
<p> NOTES     S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>NOTES	OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 3792</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
